msgstr "Ein kostenloses Admin-Toolkit für Simple File List"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:49
msgid ""
"The Simple File List Tools plugin provides professional debugging tools, "
"custom tweaks system, and administrative utilities to enhance your "
"development experience."
msgstr ""
"Das Plugin „Simple File List Tools“ bietet professionelle Debugging-Tools, "
"ein System für benutzerdefinierte Anpassungen sowie "
"Verwaltungsdienstprogramme, um Ihre Entwicklungserfahrung zu verbessern."

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:51
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr "Wichtigste Merkmale:"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:61
msgid "Completely free for all Simple File List admins."
msgstr "Für alle Administratoren von Simple File List völlig kostenlos."

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:65
msgid "Download Free Tools Plugin"
msgstr "Plugin „Free Tools“ herunterladen"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:78
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:82
msgid "Easy setup in just a few steps"
msgstr "Einfache Einrichtung in nur wenigen Schritten"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:92
msgid ""
"The plugin integrates seamlessly using WordPress hooks - no modifications to "
"core files required."
msgstr ""
"Das Plugin lässt sich nahtlos über WordPress-Hooks integrieren – Änderungen "
"an den Kern-Dateien sind nicht erforderlich."

